---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="About AI Tools Optimizer and Andrew.">
  <section class="container section prose">
    <span class="pill">// about</span><h1>About <span class="grad">AI Tools Optimizer</span></h1>
    <p>AI Tools Optimizer helps everyday people, creators and small businesses understand AI and choose the tools that actually save them time and money.</p>
    <p>I'm Andrew. I test AI tools hands-on, write plain-English guides, and keep a curated directory so you don't have to sift through hundreds of options yourself.</p>
    <h2>How we review tools</h2>
    <ul class="check"><li>We use each tool on real tasks before rating it.</li><li>Ratings consider output quality, ease of use, pricing and support.</li><li>Affiliate partnerships never change a rating.</li><li>Reviews are re-checked regularly and dated.</li></ul>
    <h2>How the site is funded</h2>
    <p>The site is free to read. It's supported by display ads, affiliate links (clearly disclosed) and our own ebooks.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions or partnership ideas? Email <a href="mailto:contact@aitoolsoptimizer.com">contact@aitoolsoptimizer.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
